  CRUCIAL fact: the product rank rank(mult(A)) is exactly the corner entry r_{0N}, equivalently
  the corner Kostant multiplicity m_{0N}.
- Orbit-closure order (Abeasis–Del Fra, type A equioriented): O_s ⊆ closure(O_r) ⟺ s ≤ r
  entrywise in the rank pattern. (Higher rank pattern ⟹ bigger closure.)
- Per-orbit codimension (Voigt / Ext): codim_Rep(O_m) = Σ_{1≤i≤u≤j≤v≤N} m_{(i-1)(j-1)} · m_{uv}.
- Define Σ^r_d = {A : rank(mult(A)) = r} and its closure Σbar^r_d = {A : rank(mult(A)) ≤ r}.

